                "title": "Modern Chic Mortise Lockset",
                "description": "The Modern Chic Mortise Lockset has a sleek look that goes well in almost any contemporary decore. This entryset is not only stylish, it is tough. Built to withstand heavy use, the commercial grade, UL listed, and fire rated mortise lock combines precision engineering for security and durability with attractive design. The Modern Chic Mortise Entryset is available in several lockable functions to meet your specific needs. \r\n",
